{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f4e2e47d-7e0e-8870-9622-842e4a316724",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:00:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I'm calling about the storm drain out front of my house. It backed up Saturday and water came into the cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, I'm sorry. Let me get some details. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "353 Ruggles Avenue. Up Historic Hill, [inaudible] near the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you cut out a little. Was that 353 Ruggles Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Three fifty-three. Sorry, reception's bad in the kitchen. Hang on, let me move."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Better? Can you hear me now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better. So the storm drain in front of 353 Ruggles backed up during the nor'easter, Friday into Saturday, and you've got water in the cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Street was a pond. Water was up to the hubcaps on my car, parked right there. Then it came down the cellar stairs, a few inches. Never happened before, and I've been in this house years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches in the cellar, first time. Okay. Is the drain itself blocked, do you know? Leaves, debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Packed with leaves. Whole grate covered. Nobody's cleaned it since I moved in, far as I can tell. I want it cleaned out before next storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for the catch basin to be cleaned. Is the water still in your cellar now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly pumped out, shop vac. Still damp. Sorry, one sec. [pause] Maeve, I'm on the phone, honey. She's at the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, no problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She keeps telling me everything she sees. Truck. Dog. Puddle. Now she says the puddle's gone. Which, good, but it'll be back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if the drain's clogged, it likely will come back with the next heavy rain. That's why we want a crew to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm saying. Can somebody come soon? Not next week sometime, with another storm [line breaks up] forecast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up there. Did you say there's another storm forecast?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Said I keep hearing rain's coming. Don't want to do this again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Crews are backed up after the weekend, so I'd guess it's a matter of days rather than hours, but I'll mark it as a flooded property so it gets priority. Can I have a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-four. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Siobhan Kearney. K-E-A-R-N-E-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Siobhan Kearney. So that's 353 Ruggles Avenue, storm drain clogged with leaves, flooding in the street and a few inches in your cellar, request to clean the drain. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Just get someone out there, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. The request goes in right now. If it floods again before they get there, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
